Antigravity Secure Endpoint - reference implementation

This is a proof-of-concept reference implementation provided "as is", without warranty of any kind,
for evaluation and adaptation. It is not an officially supported product. Endpoint controls in this
repository (AppArmor, root scripts, nftables) are stand-ins for enterprise EDR, MDM and SSE tooling.
Validate security, compliance and cost implications in your own environment before production use.

